            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Levels full of non-stop action, including highly hazardous environments: Underwater, Volcano, Space, Dark Cave, Railroad<br></li><li>Huge bosses that pack a punch. Boss rush extra mode.<br></li><li>Optional scanline screen FX, as seen in trailer.<br></li><li>25 weapons (two same weapons stack up to higher power).<br></li><li>Steam Trading Cards.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements.<br></li><li>Dozens of new weapons, developed via technology tree between the levels.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lead Programmer - Xitilon</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Programmer and Visual Designer - Lowixsama</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music and Sound - Darkman007</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Concept and Visual Designer - Satterion</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trailer - Lowixsama</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Greenlight Trailer - Dr. Z10</h2>",
